    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just the money. it's the way it feels. like i'm just waiting to hit the ground and show everyone how much of a loser i really am. the thought of having to explain this, the pity in their eyes... i can't stand the idea of being a cautionary tale. i just want it to be over before the humiliation becomes the only thing people remember about me.",
